Kick-off note for the Q4 customs migration. Dutch customs switches from the o=
ld declaration system to DMS. Our declarations go out through the customs gat=
eway, from SAP and from Nordline as forwarder. Go-live is planned for 3 Nov 2=
026.

My proposal for the workstreams:
- Marta: contact with the customs test team, test cases, export mapping
- Hanna: EWM side, so that nothing changes in Rotterdam while we cut over
- Me: Nordline, planning, reporting to Mark

Please flag anything that threatens 3 Nov as early as possible. I would like =
a first status in two weeks.

Best regards,
Ruud Jansen
